      <title>Dancing Towards Your Dreams: LSMSA Alum Balances Medicine and Movement</title>
                                                      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      <link>https://www.lsmsa.edu/page/news-detail?pk=1666855&amp;nc=20751&amp;fromId=249284</link>
                                                      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      <description>NATCHITOCHES, LA – When Madeline Lorio, a 2021 LSMSA graduate, returned to the Treen Auditorium stage in the fall of 2025 as a choreographer and dancer for the Informal Fall Dance Concert, it was more than a homecoming performance. It was a moment of affirmation. She was living out a lesson she first learned at LSMSA: you don’t have to choose between your passions.</description>
                                                      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
